{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Y'can use railguns, y'can shoot energy blasts... Ain't nothin' sweeter than dukin' it out here in virtual reality!": "",
  "Warp Spaces... it's as if they're connected by a hyperspace tunnel. Go through 'em and watch yerself get whisked away!": "",
  "Beatin' up baddies on Battle Spaces'll earn ya somethin' good, I tell ya! For instance, more dice or items!": "",
  "Kuro-nyan's always been up to no good... Believe me, I've had my fair share of run-ins with that damn cat...": "",
  "My body's colored baby blue—perfect for Kamurocho's next top mascot!": "",
  "Ain't nothin' better than sweet potato shochu n' some dried shredded squid... Ehh? Yer sayin' mascots don't do that?": "",
  "Yer here! Hope ya line yer pockets with so much cash, it'll chafe against yer lanky human legs! Gahah!": "",
  "This bum's just a 1-star scrub. Hardly worth the buckle on his belt! Betcha could beat him with one arm tied!": "",
  "This battle's only a 1-star, so if anything it'll be a good warm-up! Now go pound 'em into data dust, sonny boy!": "",
  "This here's a 1-star Battle Space, so it should be a good way to test your strength!": "",
  "A puny 1-star Battle Space with puny 1-star enemies. Here's yer opportunity to gather up some extra dice!": "",
  "This's a 1-star battle. Shouldn't give ya one bit of trouble! Now go out n' show 'em what's what!": "",
  "This one's a 2-star, so it might be a bit more difficult. But I believe in ya, sonny! Do that kung fu stuff y'always do!": "",
  "Ya landed on a 2-star Battle Space, so get ready for a good challenge. Remember t'keep yer guard up!": "",
  "Y'got yerself a 2-star battle on yer hands, big man! Ready t'send 'em to the recycle bin? Good! ": "",
  "Ah, a Battle Space it is! It's a 2-star scuffle, so y'can never be too careful!": "",
  "2 stars on this boy... Sure, it might seem a bit imposin', but I'm sure y'got what it takes!": "",
  "Ooh. 3 stars. Hrm. How should I put this... Yer opponents look like they could crush ya. But you'll be okay... right?": "",
  "Ya landed on a 3-star Battle Space! That means I might hafta clean up whatever's left of ya... I-I mean, you'll be fine!": "",
  "This here's a 3-star Battle Space, so don't expect an easy victory... In fact, I'd write out a will if I were you!": "",
  "It's a 3-star Battle Space! Hrm... This ain't gonna be a walk in the park, I'll tell ya right now...": "",
  "3 stars... These guys ain't no pushovers, but you'll really rake it in if you win. So go make 'em say uncle!": "",
  "Gotta admit, that was a tough one. Welp, back to square one!": "",
  "Y'really slipped up, y'know... Now we're gettin' booted back to the beginnin'!": "",
  "That's a gosh dern shame. Looks like we gotta start all over again.": "",
  "Terrible! I never seen a lad get his arse handed to him so swift! Ya like startin' over, is that it!?": "",
  "Y'ever hear of a concept called \"eternal return\"? Welp, yer about to live it: back to the start fer you, sonny!": "",
  "Here we go, it's Destruction Battle time! Now y'can relieve all that pent-up stress, sonny boy! Feel the rage!": "",
  "Ready for a Destruction Battle? Okay, get in there n' smash stuff up!": "",
  "This's a Destruction Battle! Just as the name suggests, yer goal is to destroy everythin'!": "",
  "This here's a Drone Battle! Show me what yer drone can do!": "",
  "Y'look like yer ready for a Drone Battle! Let's fly!": "",
  "The Drone Battle's about t'get started! Shoot 'em down, shoot 'em down!": "",
  "Hey, y'got an item! Makes ya more excited to win now, don't it?": "",
  "Hey, y'got an item! Way to go!": "",
  "Gettin' somethin' nice always puts me in a winnin' mood, y'know?": "",
  "Looks like you got somethin' special! You can actually only get that item in virtual Kamurocho.": "",
  "Nice! Let's keep the dice rollin'!": "",
  "You can check whatcha got by pressin' \n<symbol=button_sankaku>!": "",
  "Wonder if y'can run across this in the real Kamurocho, too...": "",
  "Hot diggety dog! Betcha could exchange this for a lot!": "",
  "Oh! That's a neat li'l doodad y'picked up.": "",
  "Wahah! Yer doin' pretty good! Keep it up n' we'll reach the goal in no time flat!": "",
  "Ooh, yer gettin' closer to the goal, I can feel it! But ya don't have much dice left, so be careful!": "",
  "The goal draws near! Now it's all up to whether y'have enough dice...!": "",
  "Yer almost at the goal! I'm a li'l worried about how much dice y'have left, but don't let that stop ya!": "",
  "The goal's just around the bend, sonny! Y'gotta end this once n' fer all by nabbin' the big prize!": "",
  "The goal's so close! Don't let yer journey end here! Be vigiliant with every step ya take!": "",
  "The goal's right there! Stay sharp n' keep yer wits about ya!": "",
  "Y'got some more dice! Wanna take a breather somewhere?": "",
  "All right! Y'got more dice!": "",
  "Wahah! Beat the game with a lot o'dice and get a higher bonus!": "",
  "A Dice Plus Space! Yer one lucky sonuvagun, y'know!": "",
  "Yee-haw! Feels good t'see that dice number go up...": "",
  "Yeeargh... Y'lost some dice... Try to get some more when y'can.": "",
  "Yeowch, a Dice Minus... What rotten luck!": "",
  "Yer dice got lost in an endless stream of deleted data... But new dice're always bein' born too!": "",
  "Yeeargh... That was some awful timin'...": "",
  "N-No need to fret, sonny! Y'can get more dice on Battle Spaces or Dice Plus Spaces! Keep yer chin up!": "",
  "Here we are at the Warp Space! This'll teleport yer scrawny behind to an entirely different space on the board!": "",
  "Ready to enter hyperspace? Then let's go!": "",
  "A Warp Space! Ready t'make the jump?": "",
  "Ahh, a Gift Space! Good job! I wonder what you'll get?": "",
  "Awright, a Gift Space! Take what you can get, eh?": "",
  "Hm? Looks like yer about to get somethin'!": "",
  "Hmm, a Gift Space. Wonder what you'll get? I got a feelin' it's somethin' real good!": "",
  "Wahah! Looks like there's a present for ya!": "",
  "Failure! Back to the start ya go!": "",
  "Yer all outta dice! Which means...": "",
  "It's game over fer ya! That's too bad. But I'll be waitin' till ya return!": "",
  "Hey! Ya completely ran outta dice!": "",
  "Sorry, but that means this game is over... Let's reach the goal next time.": "",
  "Looks like ya don't have enough dice! That means...": "",
  "This game's come to an abrupt end... but we'll do better next time!": "",
  "Y'ran outta health again... I can get ya all patched up, but yer gonna hafta go back to the beginnin'!": "",
  "Yer health's all gone! Fine, I s'pose I should restore ya... but that means you'll get booted back to the start!": "",
  "Y'lost all of your health. I'll give ya another chance, but you'll hafta start over again!": "",
  "Hey, hey! Scat happens, y'know? Try not to feel too bad...": "",
  "What happened there? Well, don't worry too hard, you'll get another chance!": "",
  "It's difficult to pick locks, eh? Welp, better luck next time!": "",
  "Wahah! I knew y'could do it! That's some good stuff, ain't it?": "",
  "Ooh-hoo! No wonder this was tucked away in a safe.": "",
  "Nice goin', sonny boy! This'll be worth a ton!": "",
  "Nice goin', sonny! I have a feelin' there's another King Koro-nyan around!": "",
  "Looks like there's another King Koro-nyan in town! Check it out on the map.": "",
  "Good job, sonny! There should be another King Koro-nyan in town!": "",
  "That was a close call! Looks like ya stopped Kuro-nyan from showin' up again!": "",
  "Ya prevented more Kuro-nyans from appearin'! Good job, sonny!": "",
  "Looks like ya managed to keep Kuro-nyan outta town! Couldn't have done it better m'self!": "",
  "Meeyow! Another Kuro-nyan appeared on the map!": "",
  "I'm worried there might be another Kuro-nyan... Check it out on yer map fer me, will ya?": "",
  "Whoooaaa! I detect another Kuro-nyan! We better watch our step from now on...": "",
  "Hnnngh! I have a bad feeling... I sense the presence of a Kuro-nyan nearby!": "",
  "I feel the mighty presence of King Koro-nyan nearby!\nI reckon we should seek him out!": "",
  "Good t'see ya, O Magnificent King Koro-nyan! ...Y'know what this means, don't ya!": "",
  "Someone call the internet police, 'cause ya done goofed! Why'd ya run into Kuro-nyan like that!?": "",
  "Yeeeee-haaawww!!! It's time for Koro-nyan Mode, big boy!!! We're about t'get filthy rich!!!": "",
  "I can feel the power wellin' up inside my cubical feline frame!!! Let's roll around the board n' make a mint!": "",
  "The time has finally come... to unleash my true power!!! It's my turn, baby!!!": "",
  "Aaaand the Knockout Battle begins! Send 'em all flyin'!!!": "",
  "Focus, my wayward pupil of a son! The Knockout Battle's beginnin'!": "",
  "♪ I'm gonna knock 'em out! ♪ Ma said knock 'em out! ♪ ...What, it's a Knockout Battle, after all!": "",
  "Y'ready? Then let's begin the Knockout Battle!": "",
  "Y'knew it was comin', didn't ya? It's time for a Knockout Battle!": "",
  "It's time t'break everythin' in sight! That's right, it's a Destruction Battle!": "",
  "I'm gonna send ya head-first into a Destruction Battle, so get ready to wreck stuff up!": "",
  "The more ya break, the better yer bonus! So bust up the entire place! Leave nothin' unscathed!": "",
  "This here's a Special Destruction Battle! What makes it so special? I dunno! Just wreak havoc like y'normally do!!!": "",
  "The tension's thick as butter... All the pent-up rage about to be released... Let the Destruction Battle begin!!!": "",
  "A fine job as always! Here's a li'l bonus fer ya!": "",
  "That sure was somethin', sonny! Here's yer bonus!": "",
  "That was pretty good! Take your bonus n' don't spend it all in one place!": "",
  "That didn't go too well... Do better next time!": "",
  "Yer items got stolen, sonny! Find that gosh dang Kuro-nyan on the map and get after him!": "",
  "Kuro-nyan nabbed yer items! Unforgiveable! Let's get him!": "",
  "That connivin' little con-artist! He robbed ya for all yer worth! Make him pay up double, sonny boy!": "",
  "Good thing ya didn't have nothin' on ya. Put that in yer pipe n' smoke it, Kuro-nyan!": "",
  "*sniff sniff* I smell the items we were carryin'. That means...": "",
  "Found him! All right, sonny! Beat this bunglin' burglar n' get those items back!": "",
  "Ahh... sweet, sweet revenge! Oh, ya got your items back, too! Wonderful!": "",
  "You ended up gettin' more than y'started with! Do watch out fer Kuro-nyan next time, though!": "",
  "Y'lost... but y'still have time! Do yer best and find as many items as you can!": "",
  "He got away...! Well, don't let it weigh on yer mind. Y'can always collect more items anyway!": "",
  "The dice came out as 5, 6 and 2... Activatin' Startup Sequence: Koro-nyan Mode!": "",
  "I just saw Kaito-san in Nakamichi Alley, but he was in a really good mood.": "",
  "Was that his friend with him? I've never seen that guy so happy.": "",
  "Hm? Something wrong? You guys must have time to kill at Yagami Detective Agency.": "",
  "Kaito-san was cruisin' hard through Nakamichi Alley. You'll see when you get there.": "",
  "Oh... hey there.": "",
  "Hey. I didn't catch you at a bad time, did I?": "",
  "Oh, no, not at all. I'm actually glad you're taking me out.": "",
  "For some reason I thought I wouldn't see you again...": "",
  "What made you think that?": "",
  "I'm... not sure. I guess it's just something I felt.": "",
  "You seem pretty down, Tsukino-chan.": "",
  "Yeah, I know... And you came all this way to see me, too...": "",
  "Well, why don't we go have some fun? Maybe that would help cheer you up.": "",
  "Okay. That sounds nice.": "",
  "Personally, I'd rather go de-stress somewhere...": "",
  "But if you wanted to do something in particular, I'd be okay with that too.": "",
  "(I take it she has a lot on her mind. Where would be a good place to take her?)": "",
  "Ever been to a casino before?": "",
  "A casino? Actually no, I haven't!": "",
  "Well, I know of a pretty interesting one nearby. How about we go together?": "",
  "Hmm... Would they really let me in, though?": "",
  "You're not underage or anything, so it shouldn't be a problem. Besides, it's a good learning experience.": "",
  "...All right. It's not like I get to play at a casino every day.": "",
  "Awesome. Then let's head on over.": "",
  "How about we play some darts? That should get you pumped up.": "",
  "...Mm, I doubt I'd make a very good opponent.": "",
  "Don't worry, I'll go easy on you.": "",
  "But... I don't exactly have the best aim.": "",
  "Ah, it's not that hard. You'll get the hang of it.": "",
  "...Okay. At least I'll give it a shot.": "",
  "Want to go to the batting center? It's always nice to have a little exercise.": "",
  "Sure. I've wanted to try that at least once.": "",
  "All right then. Then let's head on over.": "",
  "Hey, that was awesome!": "",
  "Wasn't it?": "",
  "Totally! I'm glad I could finally blow off some steam.": "",
  "That's good to hear. Maybe we should grab some tea and relax for a bit?": "",
  "Sounds good. I was having so much fun, I didn't realize how tired I was.": "",
  "(Maybe now would be a good time to ask what's on her mind?)": "",
  "Is everything okay, Tsukino-chan? I heard there was something bothering you.": "",
  "Oh, you mean what my brother was talking about? Honestly... it's nothing to worry about.": "",
  "Besides... I can figure it out on my own.": "",
  "You sure? I wouldn't mind listening, at least.": "",
  "Nope, not necessary. I wouldn't wanna get you all tangled up in my problems...": "",
  "I wouldn't call it that... It's just that people are worried about you. Namely, your brother and I.": "",
  "Sorry. I need some time to think this through.": "",
  "(Looks like she won't tell me just yet. Maybe she needs to be more comfortable with me first.)": "",
  "You're always welcome to share what's on your mind, Tsukino-chan. Especially if something's not right.": "",
  "Well, something's definitely not right...": "",
  "Okay, then, maybe I can help you somehow. Or at least you'll feel better by letting it all out.": "",
  "Then will you promise not to tell my brother?": "",
  "Of course. Maintaining confidentiality between me and my clients is one of my basic tenets.": "",
  "Otherwise I wouldn't be much of a detective, now would I?": "",
  "Hehe, true. I'm glad I can trust you, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Your brother did seem pretty worried, though... Are you sure you don't want to tell him?": "",
  "I'm 100% sure! Do <font_kind=yakuza_italic>not</font_kind> get him involved in this, okay?": "",
  "Okay. If you're that adamant about it, then I'll keep it between us.": "",
  "So what's been eating away at you?": "",
  "It may not seem like a big deal to you, but...": "",
  "...I'm worried about my future.": "",
  "How far into the future are we talking here?": "",
  "Well. I'm in my third year of college and I've been job hunting nonstop...": "",
  "But my parents told me to come back home and now I'm stuck on what to do.": "",
  "So they just want you closer to home?": "",
  "No. That alone would've been fine...": "",
  "What they want is for me to get married. You see... I'm in an arranged marriage.": "",
  "Wait, are you serious!?": "",
  "But that would mean... you don't have any control over who you spend your life with.": "",
  "Yeah. Pretty much.": "",
  "And your parents are really going through with this?": "",
  "Not if I had any say in it.": "",
  "An arranged marriage, though... in this day and age. Don't they respect how you feel?": "",
  "The way I see it, my parents treat me like some kind of bargaining chip. Like they're some kind of modern royalty and I'm their little princess.": "",
  "So basically they can marry me off to whoever they want as long as it benefits the family... that's all this really is.": "",
  "I see... No wonder you seem so stressed out.": "",
  "I take it you're from a pretty well-off family, then?": "",
  "You could say that. My father is a CEO.": "",
  "Ah... so that's how it is.": "",
  "So, you're definitely against this arranged marriage thing, right?": "",
  "Heck yes I'm against it! That's why I came out to Tokyo in the first place!": "",
  "I'm sick of doing only what my parents tell me to do. It's like they want to decide everything for me!": "",
  "Did you tell them you were looking for a job?": "",
  "No... I haven't. They probably wouldn't listen to me anyway.": "",
  "Are you sure? I would think that, as parents, they'd listen if their daughter had a heart-to-heart talk...": "",
  "Fat chance. They've been holding this marriage over my head ever since I was little.": "",
  "And if they found out I was job hunting, they'd cut me off financially. Then how would I live?": "",
  "I see. Is this why you couldn't tell Yosuke?": "",
  "Yeah. I don't think he'd tell my parents on purpose, but he can be careless sometimes. So I didn't want it to slip...": "",
  "Right. But this is very problematic. You want to work toward a career, but your parents want you to get married...": "",
  "...What do you think I should do?": "",
  "Why not see if you can get a job offer first? You can at least get through some interviews before having that talk.": "",
  "...I guess that is an option. Although I'm sure they'll just get pissed in the end anyway.": "",
  "How's your job hunting coming along?": "",
  "Well... I've been applying to all these companies, but no one wants to hire me.": "",
  "That must suck...": "",
  "I'm fine until the interview starts. Then... I dunno, it's like I freeze up.": "",
  "*sigh* ...Wish I could just get this over with.": "",
  "And you still haven't talked to your parents?": "",
  "No, because I know it'll be a waste of time. I tried dancing around the issue before...": "",
  "Let's just say they weren't too thrilled.": "",
  "Hmm... So that's what you're dealing with...": "",
  "Would you mind sharing a bit more about your personal life? Up until now, I've only really seen you as a client.": "",
  "Oh, but I do know what kind of panties you wear.": "",
  "Ugh. You still remember that?": "",
  "Well... not very clearly, no.": "",
  "Thank god! I thought I was gonna die of embarrassment...": "",
  "I would hope not.": "",
  "Oh, I remember quite well. Let's see, they were all black or red, with intricate little laces...": "",
  "Ahhh! Ahhhhh!": "",
  "You need to forget that right now! And I mean wipe it completely from your memory, or else!": "",
  "How could I forget something like that? Detectives are all about the details.": "",
  "Is there a fire extinguisher nearby? Maybe if I hit your head with something hard enough...!": "",
  "Whoa, hang on! That's a crime you're talking about! Plus, I don't think that's how you wipe a person's memory.": "",
  "Why... Why do bad things always happen to me?": "",
  "I want you to know me for more than just my underwear...": "",
  "Believe me, I do too.": "",
  "(What can I ask that would help me get to know her a little better...)": "",
  "Do you have any hobbies?": "",
  "Hmm. Let me think. Umm...": "",
  "I do enjoy drawing.": "",
  "Oh. Drawing, huh...": "",
  "Yeah. I've always loved drawing, even as a kid. I still pick up a pen and paper from time to time.": "",
  "Can you show me something you've drawn?": "",
  "No. Freaking. Way. My drawings are nowhere near good enough to be seen by another person.": "",
  "Ah, that's too bad...": "",
  "I know your preference for panties, but what about your other undergarments?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Wait, are you serious!?": "เดี๋ยว คุณพูดจริงเหรอ!?",
  "Do you have any hobbies?": "มีงานอดิเรกไหม"
 }
}
